COMPILATION OF: E48E8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48E8

   1 a 0000 E48E8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2e] a BIT(1) item behind a file attach: put
   4 a 0006      file(outf) list(b, 'X').  [C325] measures the non-final bit
   5 a 0006      item on the CONSOLE route with its own ?PNBOP tail and one
   6 a 0006      final ?QIOOP; [C296] measures the file statement as attach + N
   7 a 0006      item chains + one ?QIOOP.  No object combines the two. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('E8OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list(b, 'X');
  12 c 0048   close file(outf);
  13 c 004E   stop;
  14 a 0051 end E48E8;

CODE SIZE = 0051
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3892
END  COMPILATION
